From: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:15:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/31] [AMD] dsa: Compute the split indexer's owned pages and
 lens once per forward

They depend only on the forward's page table and lens, so the 21 indexer
layers of a verify step reuse the first layer's result. A new forward
metadata object, a non-increasing layer id or different inputs recompute.
Still behind SGLANG_DSA_DCP_SPLIT_DECODE_INDEXER.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
